# Other software's files — clean-room boundary enforcement.
#
# These patterns block accidental staging of application bundles and
# compiled interface files. The full check (bundles, binaries, interface
# files, icons, installers, help documents) is
# scripts/check-no-foreign-assets.sh, which runs as an opt-in pre-commit
# hook (.githooks/pre-commit) and is run by the maintainer with --all before
# merging outside contributions. See AGENTS.md "What stays out of the repo".
*.app/
**/*.nib
.herenow/
